WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:02.101
-Now here's how it works.

00:00:02.101 --> 00:00:03.402
We're each gonna take turns
drawing these cards.

00:00:03.402 --> 00:00:06.272
Each card has five totally
random questions on it.

00:00:06.272 --> 00:00:07.807
One person asks the questions.

00:00:07.807 --> 00:00:10.276
The other person has to answer
each question as soon as

00:00:10.276 --> 00:00:12.345
it's asked,
and I mean immediately. Okay?

00:00:12.345 --> 00:00:14.347
It doesn't matter if the answer
is right or wrong.

00:00:14.347 --> 00:00:15.781
It just has to be the
very first thing

00:00:15.781 --> 00:00:17.917
that pops in your head, okay?
-I'm terrified.

00:00:17.917 --> 00:00:19.285
-Phoebe,
because you are the guest,

00:00:19.285 --> 00:00:21.087
I will read
your questions first.

00:00:21.087 --> 00:00:23.690
-Okay.
-You ready for this? Here we go.

00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:25.691
-Okay.
-Got a little lighting change?

00:00:25.691 --> 00:00:29.628
-Oh, my God.
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:29.628 --> 00:00:31.497
-Ready?
-Yeah.

00:00:31.497 --> 00:00:33.233
-What's in your pocket?
-Fingerprints.

00:00:33.233 --> 00:00:35.101
[ Laughter ]
-Where do you go when you need

00:00:35.101 --> 00:00:37.069
to cry?
-Big balloon.

00:00:37.069 --> 00:00:41.107
-Why did you yell at Debra?
-Because she did the thing!

00:00:41.107 --> 00:00:43.676
-How old are most teenagers?
-Seven.

00:00:43.676 --> 00:00:47.580
[ Laughter ]
-Tell me something cool.

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:49.949
-Baloo-Ba da ba-ba ba-boo.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.949 --> 00:00:51.851
-Oh, fantastically cool.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:51.851 --> 00:00:55.855
Wow, that was so cool.
-That was bizarre.

00:00:55.855 --> 00:00:58.424
-Now, it's my turn.

00:00:58.424 --> 00:01:00.393
Phoebe, whenever you're ready,
you can ask away.

00:01:00.393 --> 00:01:02.128
-Okay.
-Okay, this is good, yeah.

00:01:02.128 --> 00:01:03.429
-Did the light go down
for you as well?

00:01:03.429 --> 00:01:04.864
-Debra knows what she did,
by the way.

00:01:04.864 --> 00:01:06.599
-Debra does know.
-She knows what she did.

00:01:06.599 --> 00:01:09.101
-She knows.
I have to wait for the lights?

00:01:09.101 --> 00:01:13.273
-Here you go. Ready?

00:01:13.273 --> 00:01:16.509
-What's your secret talent?
-I can, uh -- sing.

00:01:16.509 --> 00:01:17.743
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:17.743 --> 00:01:19.645
-Whose fault is it?
-Gary's.

00:01:19.645 --> 00:01:20.947
[ Laughter ]
-When is the best time

00:01:20.947 --> 00:01:22.649
to hug someone?
-5:00 A.M.

00:01:22.649 --> 00:01:23.982
[ Laughter ]

00:01:23.982 --> 00:01:26.185
-What movie will win best
picture three years from now?

00:01:26.185 --> 00:01:28.354
-The Long Windy Place.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:28.354 --> 00:01:30.256
-Sing your favorite salad
topping.

00:01:30.256 --> 00:01:35.194
[ Light laughter ]
-♪ Croutons ♪

00:01:35.194 --> 00:01:37.830
[ Ding ]
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:37.830 --> 00:01:38.964
-Salad topping.
-I love it.

00:01:38.964 --> 00:01:41.601
-Sounds like a salad dressing.
All right.

00:01:41.601 --> 00:01:42.902
-Okay.
-This is round --

00:01:42.902 --> 00:01:44.871
-I love this game.
-The final round in this round,

00:01:44.871 --> 00:01:47.473
we'll both pick up a card
with the same set of questions.

00:01:47.473 --> 00:01:50.576
We'll ask them and answer
them back and forth.

00:01:50.576 --> 00:01:53.079
And I'll start.
Okay, ready?

00:01:53.079 --> 00:01:54.681
-Hmm.
-Hmm.

00:01:54.681 --> 00:01:57.883
-Hmm.

00:01:57.883 --> 00:02:00.386
-What's the first thing you say
when you wake up?

00:02:00.386 --> 00:02:02.454
-Bing!
[ Laughter ]

00:02:02.454 --> 00:02:05.625
Why are you scared right now?
-I don't like spiders.

00:02:05.625 --> 00:02:07.693
-Where is the best place to get
married?

00:02:07.693 --> 00:02:09.862
-In an tiny, tiny,
tiny little box.

00:02:09.862 --> 00:02:13.499
[ Laughter ]
What's the funniest thing you

00:02:13.499 --> 00:02:16.035
own?
-A car.

00:02:16.035 --> 00:02:20.473
[ Laughter ]
Oh, sorry.

00:02:20.473 --> 00:02:22.675
What's the secret to making it
in Hollywood?

00:02:22.675 --> 00:02:25.010
-Blinking.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:25.010 --> 00:02:28.681
Make up a name for a song?
-"Time to get back, Jack."

00:02:28.681 --> 00:02:30.883
[ Laughter ]
-Yes.

00:02:30.883 --> 00:02:35.087
-How do you smile?
-Like -- that.

00:02:35.087 --> 00:02:37.990
[ Laughter ]
What's another name for a horse?

00:02:37.990 --> 00:02:40.226
-A cantor.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.226 --> 00:02:44.230
Why is it so hard?
-Because it's wet.

00:02:44.230 --> 00:02:47.800
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:55.808 line:0%
♪♪

00:02:55.808 --> 00:02:58.678
Oh, my God.

00:02:58.678 --> 00:03:01.147
-That was "Think Fast"
with Phoebe Waller-Bridge.

00:03:01.147 --> 00:03:02.381
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:02.381 --> 00:03:05.552
"Fleabag" is available
on Amazon Prime video.

